*(Musterlösung selbst erstellt, kompiliert)*

```java
import javafx.scene.text.Font;
import javafx.scene.text.FontWeight;

// Variante 1: Font-Objekt
outputField.setFont(Font.font("TIMES NEW ROMAN", FontWeight.BOLD, 14));

// Variante 2: CSS
outputField.setStyle("-fx-font-family: 'TIMES NEW ROMAN';" +
                     "-fx-font-weight: bold;" +
                     "-fx-font-size: 14;");

// Button-Text
